  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting children with cancer in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Approximately 2,000 children are expected to develop cancer each year in Myanmar. Due to a lack of awareness of childhood cancer, an inability to accurately diagnose cases and the prohibitive cost of transport, the number of newly diagnosed cases is far lower than expected for the country.</narrative>
